'''Meteor Cafe''' was a [[restaurant]] on the [[planet]] [[Orondia]] at the time of the [[Clone Wars]],<ref name="FAE" /> and [[Horizon Base]] at the time of the [[Galactic Civil War]].<ref name="Droid" /> During the [[First Order-Resistance War]] decades later, an advertisement for the company was seen on the exterior of [[Vranki's Hotel and Casino]], a [[space station]] in the [[Voxx Cluster]].<ref name="Voxx">{{Resistance|The Voxx Vortex 5000}}</ref> The cafe's logo featured a [[meteor]] and the words "Meteor Cafe" in [[Aurebesh]].<ref name="Trivia">{{SW|url=series/clone-wars/friends-and-enemies-trivia-gallery|text="Friends and Enemies" Trivia Gallery}} {{C|Slide 11}}</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
{{Quote|Signage at the fueling station includes: Eat at Koe's, Bounty Emporium: Always Open, Bounty Never Sleeps; Security Services; Speeder Sales; The Pilot's Lounge (Live Band Every Night); Craft Repair and Maintenance; Repair Rack Droid Services; Orondia Tours; and Meteor Cafe.|Friends and Enemies Trivia Gallery|<ref name="Trivia" />}}
Meteor Cafe was first mentioned on a sign appearing in "[[Friends and Enemies]]," the sixteenth episode of the [[The Clone Wars: Season Four|fourth season]] of ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]''.<ref name="FAE" />

